cess to software upgrades; software and hardware products for full traceability of medicines and medical supplies throughout the healthcare system; OmniSphere, a cloud-based platform. The company was formerly known as Omnicell Technologies, Inc. and changed its name to Omnicell, Inc. in 2001. Omnicell, Inc. was incorporated in 1992 and is headquartered in Fort Worth, Texas."}}